    }
  },
  "required": [
    "id",
    "senderTenantId",
    "mine",
    "body",
    "deleted",
    "createdAt"
  ],
  "description": "Use \`mine\` to decide which side of the thread to render a bubble on. Do NOT compare \`senderTenantId\` to your own tenant — the server already knows which party is asking and answers for it.\\n\\nA deleted message keeps its PLACE: \`deleted: true\` with a null \`body\`. Render it as removed rather than dropping it, or the other party's scrollback develops a hole where something they read used to be."
}"
`;

